Hello. I have solved this problem by correcting R script "MSStatsQC.r". The thing is that when Skyline generates file with raw data for MSStats it uses ";" as separator. In the script standart function read.csv() is used to read this file. But standart separator for this function is ",". So, we need to define separator. The row "raw<-read.csv(arguments[1])" should be replaced by "raw<-read.csv(arguments[1], sep=';')".

